{"v":1,"book":"Isa","ch":59,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"No, Jehovah’s hand is not so short that it cannot save; Nor is His ear so heavy that it cannot hear.","tok":[{"t":"No, Jehovah’s "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[3]},{"t":" is not so short that it cannot "},{"t":"save","s":["H3467"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; Nor is His "},{"t":"ear","s":["H0241"],"a":[8]},{"t":" so "},{"t":"heavy","s":["H3513"],"a":[7]},{"t":" that it cannot "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"But your iniquities have become a separation Between you and your God, And your sins have hidden His face From you so that He does not hear.","tok":[{"t":"But your "},{"t":"iniquities","s":["H5771"],"a":[2]},{"t":" have become a separation "},{"t":"Between","s":["H0996"],"a":[5]},{"t":" you and your "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[7]},{"t":", And your "},{"t":"sins","s":["H2403"],"a":[8]},{"t":" have hidden His "},{"t":"face","s":["H6440"],"a":[10]},{"t":" From you so that He does not "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"For your hands are defiled with blood, And your fingers with iniquity; Your lips have spoken falsehood, Your tongue has muttered injustice.","tok":[{"t":"For your "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3709"],"a":[1]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"defiled","s":["H1351"],"a":[2]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"blood","s":["H1818"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And your "},{"t":"fingers","s":["H0676"],"a":[4]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H5771"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; Your "},{"t":"lips","s":["H8193"],"a":[6]},{"t":" have "},{"t":"spoken","s":["H1696"],"a":[7]},{"t":" falsehood, Your "},{"t":"tongue","s":["H3956"],"a":[9]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"muttered","s":["H1897"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"injustice","s":["H5766"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"No one sues righteously, And no one pleads in truth; They trust in vanity and speak lies; They conceive mischief and bring forth iniquity.","tok":[{"t":"No one sues righteously, And no one "},{"t":"pleads","s":["H8199"],"a":[4]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"truth","s":["H0530"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; They "},{"t":"trust","s":["H0982"],"a":[6]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"vanity","s":["H8414"],"a":[8]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"speak","s":["H1696"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"lies","s":["H7723"],"a":[10]},{"t":"; They "},{"t":"conceive","s":["H2029"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mischief","s":["H5999"],"a":[12]},{"t":" and bring "},{"t":"forth","s":["H3205"],"a":[13]},{"t":" "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H0205"],"a":[14]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"They hatch adders’ eggs And weave the spider’s web; He who eats of their eggs dies, And that which is crushed breaks forth into a viper.","tok":[{"t":"They "},{"t":"hatch","s":["H1234"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"adders","s":["H6848"],"a":[1]},{"t":"’ "},{"t":"eggs","s":["H1000"],"a":[0]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"weave","s":["H0707"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"spider’s","s":["H5908"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"web","s":["H6980"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; He who "},{"t":"eats","s":["H0398"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of their "},{"t":"eggs","s":["H1000"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"dies","s":["H4191"],"a":[8]},{"t":", And that which is "},{"t":"crushed","s":["H2116"],"a":[9]},{"t":" breaks forth into a "},{"t":"viper","s":["H0660"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Their webs will not become garments, Nor will they cover themselves with their works; Their works are works of iniquity, And an act of violence is in their palms.","tok":[{"t":"Their "},{"t":"webs","s":["H6980"],"a":[0]},{"t":" will not become "},{"t":"garments","s":["H0899"],"a":[3]},{"t":", Nor will they "},{"t":"cover","s":["H3680"],"a":[5]},{"t":" themselves with their "},{"t":"works","s":["H4639"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; Their "},{"t":"works","s":["H4639"],"a":[7]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"works","s":["H4639"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H0205"],"a":[9]},{"t":", And an "},{"t":"act","s":["H6467"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"violence","s":["H2555"],"a":[11]},{"t":" is in their palms."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Their feet run toward evil, And they hasten to shed innocent blood; Their thoughts are thoughts of iniquity; Desolation and destruction are in their highways.","tok":[{"t":"Their "},{"t":"feet","s":["H7272"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"run","s":["H7323"],"a":[2]},{"t":" toward "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And they hasten to "},{"t":"shed","s":["H8210"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"innocent","s":["H5355"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"blood","s":["H1818"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; Their "},{"t":"thoughts","s":["H4284"],"a":[7]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"thoughts","s":["H4284"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H0205"],"a":[9]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Desolation","s":["H7701"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"destruction","s":["H7667"],"a":[11]},{"t":" are in their highways."}]},{"n":8,"text":"The way of peace they do not know, And there is no justice in their course; They have made their paths crooked; Whoever goes on it does not know peace.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"peace","s":["H7965"],"a":[1]},{"t":" they do not "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And there is no justice in their course; They have made their "},{"t":"paths","s":["H5410"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"crooked","s":["H6140"],"a":[8]},{"t":"; Whoever goes on it does not "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"peace","s":["H7965"],"a":[15]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Therefore justice is far from us, And righteousness does not overtake us; We look eagerly for light, but, ah, darkness, For brightness, but we walk in gloom.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore "},{"t":"justice","s":["H6666"],"a":[7]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"far","s":["H7368"],"a":[2]},{"t":" from us, And righteousness does not "},{"t":"overtake","s":["H5381"],"a":[6]},{"t":" us; We look eagerly for "},{"t":"light","s":["H0216"],"a":[9]},{"t":", but, ah, "},{"t":"darkness","s":["H0653"],"a":[13]},{"t":", For "},{"t":"brightness","s":["H5054"],"a":[12]},{"t":", but we "},{"t":"walk","s":["H1980"],"a":[14]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"gloom","s":["H0653"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"We grope like blind men at the wall; We grope like those without eyes; We stumble at midday as we would at dusk; Among the prospering we are like dead men.","tok":[{"t":"We "},{"t":"grope","s":["H1659"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"like","s":["H7023"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"blind","s":["H5787"],"a":[1]},{"t":" men at the "},{"t":"wall","s":["H7023"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"We","s":["H5787"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"grope","s":["H1659"],"a":[5]},{"t":" like those without "},{"t":"eyes","s":["H5869"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; We "},{"t":"stumble","s":["H3782"],"a":[6]},{"t":" at midday as we would at dusk; Among the prospering we are like "},{"t":"dead","s":["H4191"],"a":[10]},{"t":" men."}]},{"n":11,"text":"All of us roar like bears And moan incessantly like doves; We look eagerly for justice, but there is none, For salvation, but it is far from us.","tok":[{"t":"All of us "},{"t":"roar","s":["H1993"],"a":[0]},{"t":" like "},{"t":"bears","s":["H1677"],"a":[1]},{"t":" And moan incessantly like "},{"t":"doves","s":["H3123"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; We "},{"t":"look","s":["H6960"],"a":[6]},{"t":" eagerly for justice, but there is none, For "},{"t":"salvation","s":["H3444"],"a":[9]},{"t":", but it is far from us."}]},{"n":12,"text":"For our transgressions are multiplied before You, And our sins respond to You against us; For our transgressions are with us, And as for our iniquities, we know what they are:","tok":[{"t":"For our "},{"t":"transgressions","s":["H6588"],"a":[2]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"multiplied","s":["H7231"],"a":[1]},{"t":" before You, And our "},{"t":"sins","s":["H2403"],"a":[4]},{"t":" respond to You against us; For our "},{"t":"transgressions","s":["H6588"],"a":[8]},{"t":" are with us, And as for our "},{"t":"iniquities","s":["H5771"],"a":[10]},{"t":", we "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[11]},{"t":" what they are:"}]},{"n":13,"text":"Transgressing and denying Jehovah, And turning away from our God; Speaking oppression and revolt, Conceiving and uttering from the heart words of falsehood.","tok":[{"t":"Transgressing","s":["H6586"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"denying","s":["H3584"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And turning "},{"t":"away","s":["H5253"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"from","s":["H0310"],"a":[4]},{"t":" our "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Speaking","s":["H1696"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"oppression","s":["H6233"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"revolt","s":["H5627"],"a":[8]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Conceiving","s":["H2029"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"uttering","s":["H1897"],"a":[10]},{"t":" from the "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"falsehood","s":["H8267"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"And justice is turned back, And righteousness stands far off; For truth has stumbled in the street, And uprightness cannot come in.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"justice","s":["H6666"],"a":[3]},{"t":" is turned back, And righteousness "},{"t":"stands","s":["H5975"],"a":[5]},{"t":" far "},{"t":"off","s":["H7350"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; For "},{"t":"truth","s":["H0571"],"a":[9]},{"t":" has stumbled in the "},{"t":"street","s":["H7339"],"a":[8]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"uprightness","s":["H5229"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"cannot","s":["H3201"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[13]},{"t":" in."}]},{"n":15,"text":"And truth is lacking, And he who turns from evil becomes plunder. And Jehovah saw it, and it was evil in His sight That there was no justice.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"truth","s":["H0571"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is lacking, And he who turns from "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[4]},{"t":" becomes plunder. And "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"saw","s":["H7200"],"a":[6]},{"t":" it, and it was evil in His sight That there was no justice."}]},{"n":16,"text":"And He saw that there was no man, And He was appalled that there was no intercessor. Therefore His arm accomplished salvation for Him, And His righteousness sustained Him.","tok":[{"t":"And He "},{"t":"saw","s":["H7200"],"a":[0]},{"t":" that there was no "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And He was appalled that there was no "},{"t":"intercessor","s":["H6293"],"a":[7]},{"t":". Therefore His "},{"t":"arm","s":["H2220"],"a":[10]},{"t":" accomplished "},{"t":"salvation","s":["H3467"],"a":[8]},{"t":" for Him, And His "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"sustained","s":["H5564"],"a":[13]},{"t":" Him."}]},{"n":17,"text":"Thus He put on righteousness as a breastplate, And a helmet of salvation upon His head; And He put on the garments of vengeance for clothing And wrapped Himself with zeal as a mantle.","tok":[{"t":"Thus He put "},{"t":"on","s":["H3847"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[1]},{"t":" as a "},{"t":"breastplate","s":["H8302"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And a "},{"t":"helmet","s":["H3553"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"salvation","s":["H3444"],"a":[4]},{"t":" upon His "},{"t":"head","s":["H7218"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; And He put "},{"t":"on","s":["H3847"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"garments","s":["H0899"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"vengeance","s":["H5359"],"a":[8]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"clothing","s":["H8516"],"a":[9]},{"t":" And wrapped Himself with "},{"t":"zeal","s":["H7068"],"a":[12]},{"t":" as a "},{"t":"mantle","s":["H4598"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":18,"text":"According to their dealings, so will He repay: Wrath to His adversaries, recompense to His enemies; To the coastlands He will repay with recompense.","tok":[{"t":"According "},{"t":"to","s":["H5921"],"a":[0]},{"t":" their dealings, so will He "},{"t":"repay","s":["H7999"],"a":[3]},{"t":": Wrath to His "},{"t":"adversaries","s":["H6862"],"a":[5]},{"t":", recompense to His "},{"t":"enemies","s":["H0341"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; To the coastlands He will "},{"t":"repay","s":["H7999"],"a":[10]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"recompense","s":["H1576"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":1